BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rylan - Top Gun: 2014 Top Gun (Connors) - Charlie's birthday party
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260823T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260823T180000
DTSTAMP:20260731T191350
UID:9277555-370831388
SEQUENCE:3
DESCRIPTION:Location: Charlie's house !!\n Trade skates in for swimsuits.\
 n\nPlease join us as we celebrate the start of another hockey season and C
 harlie's belated 12th birthday! Charlie turned 12 while he was at camp in 
 July\, so we're looking forward to celebrating with family and friends.\n\
 nSunday\, August 23 2:00 PM- 6:00 PM\n\nCome spend the afternoon swimming\
 , relaxing\, and hanging out with teammates before the hockey season gets 
 underway.\n\nWe'll be providing pizza and drinks. If you'd like to bring a
 ppetizer or dessert to share\, you're more than welcome to. Our only reque
 st is that you take any leftovers home with you at the end of the day.\n\n
 We hope you can join us for a fun afternoon. Please let us know if you'll 
 be able to make it.  (Arrival Time:  2:00 PM (Eastern Time (US & Canada)))
  \n\nAssignments:\n\nbring your bathing suit !! : Unassigned\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260731T191350
LOCATION:4 Timothy Dr Andover\, MA\, United States
END:VEVENT
